 al literacy skills. Join us and bring your own device!\nIf you're a teen b
 etween the ages of 13-17 and would like to learn more about becoming a Sen
 iors E-Connect volunteer\, visit the\nSeniors E-Connect Volunteering page\
 nor contact the branch.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal info
 rmation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the 
 Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information
  will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evalu
