BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea and Movies: Small Things Like These (2024)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T150000
UID:69f22cd1b6c4ac1fedcf9c03@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every month for a free afternoon movie.\nTea & coffee 
 will be served. No registration required.\nThis month’s film:\nSmall Thi
 ngs Like These\n(2024)\nSet in Ireland in the 1980s\,\nSmall Things Like T
 hese\nfollows Bill Furlong\, a coal merchant and devoted family man\, who 
 makes a troubling discovery while delivering to a local convent. Faced wit
 h a choice between speaking up and staying silent\, Bill is forced to conf
 ront the quiet complicity of his community and his own conscience. This mo
 ving drama explores compassion\, courage\, and the impact of small acts of
  kindness.\nThis film is rated:\nPG-13
LOCATION:Thorncliffe
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f22cd1b6c4ac1fedcf9c03
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
