DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film. Ingredient lists will
  be available upon request.\nRise of the Superstorms\nIn the span of a sin
 gle\, catastrophic month\, Houston\, Florida\, and the Caribbean were perm
 anently altered. During the summer of 2017\, three massive hurricanes barr
 elled in from the Atlantic in rapid succession\, smashing long-standing re
 cords and claiming hundreds of lives. Closed Captions. 60 minutes. 2018
