DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260604T150000
UID:69fbb611e8af4a2f0070af0d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In recognition of Senior Safety Awareness Month this June\, To
 ronto Fire Services will be presenting a Fire Safety Presentation and Q&A 
 for older adults. The topics covered include:\nPreventing a fire from happ
 ening to you\nCauses of home fires\nPlacement/Need for smoke & CO alarms\n
 Eliminating nuisance alarms\nEscape Planning for special needs\nCalling fo
 r help (how/when/from where)\nFire safety in High-Rise buildings\nFor olde
 r adults and families. Drop-in.
LOCATION:Annette Street
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fbb611e8af4a2f0070af0d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
