BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seniors Matinee: Relay
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260625T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260625T140000
UID:69af08e58d5e2d09336425d9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:"Relay follows a world class 'fixer' who brokers lucrative pay
 offs between corrupt corporations and the individuals who threaten their r
 uin. He keeps his identity a secret through meticulous planning and always
  follows an exacting set of rules. When a new message arrives from a poten
 tial client needing his protection to stay alive\, the rules quickly start
  to change"--\nClosed Captioning\nDrop In
LOCATION:Maryvale\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69af08e58d5e2d09336425d9
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
