BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Steps to Safety: A Fire and Fall Prevention Program for Older Adul
 ts
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T150000
UID:6a089af88e677a28001c67ae@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps older adults learn how to stay safe in thei
 r home. Topics include:\nPreventing a fire from      happening\nThe placem
 ent and need for      smoke and CO alarms\nEscape planning for special    
