DESCRIPTION:June is Seniors month in Ontario! Come have some fun with us 
 while learning to make 3 different types of beeswax candles and learn abo
 ut the creators of beeswax\, bees!! You will take home 2 rolled beeswa
 x candles and 2 beeswax tealight candles that you make from scratch.\nInf
 ormation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is coll
 ected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, secti
 ons 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event
