DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T120000
UID:69e3affcbd5c392c76450081@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Seniors E-Connect matches older adults with a teen volunteer t
 o provide tech help\, under the guidance of library staff. Learn the basic
 s of using mobile devices\nand learn about topics such as library e-resour
 ces. Get one on one support in a welcoming and friendly environment.\nPlea
 se register with your phone number if you want to be reminded with a phone
  call.  One registration per person.  Do not register twice\, contact s
 taff to confirm if needed.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal i
