DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T150000
UID:69de581ccdd2f7e31fe21694@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Everything old is new again\, and native plant gardens are now
  all the rage. And for good reason! A Toronto Master Gardener will go over
 :\n- Why native plants are best adapted to (thus more successful in) our c
 limatic conditions\;\n- How they support biodiversity by providing food an
 d shelter for birds and pollinators\n- How they enhance the beauty of our 
 gardens.\nYou have everything to gain and nothing to lose by adding more n
 ative plants to your garden… come and learn how.\nThis program is part o
 f TPL's\nOur Fragile Planet\nprogram series\, supported by Friends of Toro
 nto Public Library\, South Chapter.​\nDrop-in\, no registration required
 .
