BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Computers for Beginners: Use the Internet
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T153000
UID:69dd523fb6c4ac1fedcc20ff@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Computers for Beginners is a 6-week course designed to build y
 our confidence by introducing new skills slowly in a small\, supportive co
 mmunity. At the end of the course\, you may not know everything about the 
 internet\, but you will have a solid foundation of new skills and the conf
 idence to continue learning.\nIs This Course Right for You?\nFor seniors a
 nd beginners\; those with very limited or no computer experience\n6 weeks\
 n: with 1 class per week\nWhat Will You Learn?\nBasic tools such as the mo
 use and the keyboard\nHow to search online for information\, services and 
 entertainment\nHow to use email to keep in touch with family and friends\n
 Week 1:\nUse the Mouse (May 6)\nWeek 2:\nUse the Keyboard (May 13)\nWeek 3
 :\nUse Windows (May 20)\nWeek 4:\nUse the Internet (May 27)\nAn introducto
 ry class on the Internet for absolute beginners with little computer exper
 ience.\nIn this session you will:\nUnderstand how to read a web site addre
 ss\nPractice using web addresses\nSearch for information using a search en
 gine\nExplore a web site in detail to understand its key components\nUpon 
 completion of this class students will be able to use the internet at a be
 ginner level and complete simple searches.\nPrerequisites: Computer for Be
 ginners 1 & 2 or basic mouse and keyboarding skills\nWeek 5:\nUse Google/G
 oogle Maps (June 3)\nWeek 6:\nUse Gmail (June 10)\nPlease read the followi
 ng information carefully:\nTo register for the\nWeek 1: Use the Mouse\nyou
  will need to either register\nin person at the Bloor/Gladstone Library\n\
 , or call us at\n416-393-7674\n. This first class is offline registration 
 because not everyone knows how to use the computer mouse right away. When 
 you are registering online\, you will be registered for all classes from W
 eek 2 - Week 6.\nRegistration is required.\nInformation Collection Notice:
 \nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public
  Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(
 d). The information will only be used for event and program registration\,
  delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your inf
 ormation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416
 -397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Bloor/Gladstone\, Learning Centre
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69dd523fb6c4ac1fedcc20ff
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
