UID:6a021906e8af4a2f0071ba3a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in July for a special summer edition of the Senior's 
 Club!\nThis month: Hands on Dinosaur Fossils & Ancient Life\nCome in for
  an opportunity to handle\, examine up close and discuss nine real and rep
 lica fossils in this fascinating hands-on workshop. Participants will be e
 ntertained and educated\, not just about the fossils themselves\, but the 
 palaeontological aspects that underpin them. Concepts include: evolution\,
  fossilization\, ‘The Tree of Life’ (phylogeny) and — of course — 
 dinosaurs!\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on th
 is form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Librar
 ies Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be
