UID:6a022c82e8af4a2f0071c0dd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto Fire Services (TFS) Fire Safety Public Education p
 resents about fire prevention\, detection and escape. This includes: preve
 nting a fire from happening to you\, causes of home fires placement/need
  for smoke & CO alarms\, eliminating nuisance alarms\, escape planning for
  special needs\, calling for help (how/when/from where) and fire safety in
  high-rise buildings. There is information everyone needs to know to keep 
 safe from fire!\nAccessibility\nLive or automated closed captioning\, sign
  language interpretation\, intervenor services\, or attendant services are
  available upon request. Please submit your request at least 2 weeks in ad
 vance to:\ntpl.ca/accessibility-events\n.\nDrop in
