DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T153000
UID:6a04d3d40c0f2c4503fa06a9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A class on how to use a mouse for absolute beginners with litt
 le or no computer experience.\nIn this session you will:\nObserve and prac
 tice how to operate a mouse effectively\nUnderstand various mouse pointers
  and cursors\nReview basic keyboard functions\nUse the mouse for basic Win
 dows functions\nLearn proper keyboarding posture.\nFamiliarize yourself wi
 th alphabet keys\, number keys and special symbol keys.\nPractice typing u
 sing an online tutorial.\nReview where to get more online typing practice.
 \nUpon completion of this class students will be able to use a computer mo
 use at a basic level and will be able to go online for additional practice
 .\nPrerequisites: No computer experience required.\nFormat: Hands-on with 
 demonstrations
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, 2nd Floor Learning Center
