UID:69b1bfc381b67dfe32abe7a1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join social policy expert John Stapleton to plan for your fina
 ncial future.\nIf you are a low-income earner or advise low-income earners
 \, this program will help you understand:\nTax Credits and Benefits for Se
 niors and People with Disabilities\nLearn about other tax credits and bene
 fits for seniors\, people with disabilities\, and caregivers\, including t
 he disability tax credit\, the Canada caregiver credit\, and the home acce
 ssibility tax credit.\nThis is a drop-in program. Registration is not requ
 ired.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, First Floor Program Room (CPR)
