 itle for the September 17th meeting is:\nLighter\nThe title for the Octobe
 r 15th meeting is:\nThe Power of Now\nThe title for the November 19th meet
 ing is:\nSet Boundaries\, Find Peace\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe 
