DESCRIPTION:Practice your Microsoft Word skills while creating a simple re
 sume.\nIn this class\, you will:\nFormat a simple resume\nPractice advance
 d formatting      using Ruler Tools and Format Painter\nUse Grammar and Sp
 ell check      tools\nPractice using Word’s built-in      resume templat
 es\nSave documents in other formats      such as PDF\nUpon completion of t
 his class\, you will be able to create an organized simple resume and acce
 ss resume templates with additional style options.\nPrerequisites: Word Ba
 sics 1 & 2 or equivalent skills. Keyboarding and mouse skills are required
 .\nFormat: Hands-on with demonstrations\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
 he personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d).
