BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Retirement Planning & Living
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260727T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260727T160000
UID:69c7fb8c8089f23c67652898@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:It's never too late to start thinking about investing! Managin
 g your finances to maximize your retirement years is the goal of retiremen
 t planning. Your retirement strategy should strike a balance between your 
 financial realities\, requirements and wants.\nThis presentation will cove
 r how to plan for retirement\, sources of retirement income and how to pro
 tect yourself from scams\, frauds and financial abuse.\nPresented by\nCana
 dian Investment Regulatory Organization (CIRO)\n\, a national self-regulat
 ory organization that oversees all investment dealers\, mutual fund dealer
 s and trading activity on Canada’s debt and equity marketplaces.
LOCATION:Palmerston\, Downstairs
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c7fb8c8089f23c67652898
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
