DESCRIPTION:Join us for an informative program designed to help older adul
 ts stay safe at home. Delivered in partnership with Toronto Fire Services\
 , this session focuses on essential fire safety and fall‑prevention prac
 tices to support independent living. Participants will learn about the pr
 oper placement of smoke and carbon monoxide alarms\, fire safety in high
 ‑rise buildings\, common causes of home fires\, escape planning for indi
 viduals with special needs\, and how to call for help in an emergency.
