UID:69f292672866a5b4884bb323@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Cliffcrest invites all to our Seniors Club! Hang out and enjoy
  games\, engaging presentations and workshops on a variety of topics. Exce
 pt for June Seniors Club meets on the 3rd week of every month.\nThis Mont
 h: Birding 101 – Tips for Bird Watching in Toronto\nJune is Seniors Mont
 h in Ontario! Embrace lifelong learning by learning about Birding! Birding
  is fun\, easy\, and can be done anywhere - in your own backyard\, or in a
  local park. Learn everything you need to know to get started\, from choos
 ing binoculars and field guides\, to where and when to bird in your neighb
 ourhood\, and what birds you are likely to find in the city. Find out abou
