DESCRIPTION:Gardens with habitat and food sources for birds\, bees and but
 terflies provide many benefits to both the gardener and the neighbourhood.
  These small creatures animate the garden and create endless entertainment
 . They also supply ecological services\, such as increased yields of veget
 able and fruit crops\, and passive pest control. It’s easier than you th
 ink to create a habitat-friendly garden\, and this presentation will provi
